. 
. * Loop up to 12; capture safely skips missing -12 and -11 years for the graph
. forvalues h = 12(-1)2 {
  2.     local varlist ""
  3.     forvalues i = `h'(-1)1 {
  4.         local varlist "`varlist' Tm`i'"
  5.     }
  6.     capture quietly test `varlist'
